  "title": "正義の文化",
  "created": 1786851366,
  "updated": 1786851407,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a813022e8536f1d5005ccda",
      "text": "正義の文化",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1786851366
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303d0000000000443d9c",
      "text": " 規則を守る",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851389,
      "updated": 1786851396
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303e0000000000443d9d",
      "text": "  規則違反は、例外なく処罰される文化。 ",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851390,
      "updated": 1786851404
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81304c0000000000443da0",
      "text": "  一方で、故意でないエラーに対しては寛容という面も併せ持つ。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851404,
      "updated": 1786851404
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303e0000000000443d9f",
      "text": " 公正さが失われると、大抵の人は、規則を守らなくなる。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851390,
      "updated": 1786851407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8130260000000000443d99",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1786851366
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8130260000000000443d9a",
      "text": "just culture",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1786851367
